

# <type>(<scope>): <description>
#
# <body: the motivation and what changed, wrapped at 72 characters>
#
# <footer: BREAKING CHANGE: ..., Closes #123, Refs #123>
#
# type:        feat fix refactor perf style test docs build deps ci chore
#              security release i18n a11y revert
# scope:       optional, one lowercase noun, e.g. (auth) or (api)
# description: imperative mood ("add", not "added"), lowercase after the
#              colon, no trailing period; aim for 50 characters, never
#              more than 72 in the whole subject line
# body:        only for non-trivial changes: why and what, not the diff
# breaking:    "!" after the type/scope, e.g. feat(api)!: ..., and a
#              BREAKING CHANGE: footer saying how to migrate
# Keep a blank line between subject, body and footer.
